{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Kuch der toh bheeg [C] loon,        [A#] barsaat [C] mein
[Dm] Dunga tumhe apne [C] dil,        [A#] saugaat [C] mein
Lipto naa tum [A#] mere badan [C] se,        [Gm] Paagal banaa do [F] mujhe
Utro naa [A#] tum mere zehan [C] se,        [Gm] Ye kya huaa hai [A] mujhe
[Dm] Kuch der toh bheeg [C] loon,        [A#] barsat [C] mein
[Dm] Dunga tumhe apne [C] dil,        [A#] saugaat [C] mein?
Tum [Dm] ho toh lage,        Tere [F] sang baarishein ye [Gm] haseen
[Gm] humdum [C] mere..        Chhu [Dm] lun jo tumhe
Toh [F] lage bijliyan gir [Gm] padi,        [Gm] Dil pe.. [C] mere?
Tum [C] aake bacha lo [F] mujhe,        [C] Baahon mein chhipa lo [A] mujhe..
Lipto naa [A#] tum mere ba [C] dan se,        [Gm] Paagal banaa do [F] mujhe
Utro naa [A#] tum mere zehan [C] se,        [Gm] Ye kya huaa hai [A] mujhe
[Dm] Kuch der toh bheeg [C] loon,        [A#] barsat [C] mein
[Dm] Dunga tumhe apne [C] dil,        [A#] saugaat [C] mein?
[Dm] Apne ghar ka,        [F] Rasta bhool baitha hoon
[Gm] main tumse [C] milke,        [Dm] Aao naa zara
Le [F] basa ik nayi [Gm] duniya,        [Gm] hum tum [C] milke
Koi [C] dooja nahi ho [F] wahaan,        Ho?n do [C] jism aur ek [A] jaan
